  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Coarsely chop the lettuce and tomatoes. Thinly slice the avocado (see Cooking tip). Finely chop the chives. Drain and rinse the chickpeas. Drain the corn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/390471/photos/large/62047_1-574e4c7f1558f06636ed139db0b04335.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast chickpeas: Put the chickpeas, 2 tsp Cajun spice blend and 1 tbs olive oil in a large bowl. Season with salt and pepper and toss to combine. Spread the chickpeas over the lined tray and roast for 15 mins or until crispy (see Make it yours).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/390472/photos/large/62047_2-fd241ad52d26c4bd1bb80926f12dbe5f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Char corn: Meanwhile, heat a medium frypan over high heat. Cook the corn, stirring, for 2-3 mins until slightly charred. Season with salt and pepper. Remove from the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/390473/photos/large/62047_3-66775fbe063c6a74de035ba17dd414d0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make dressing: Put 2 tbs mayonnaise, 1 tbs red wine vinegar and 1 tsp honey in a bowl. Season with salt and pepper and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/390474/photos/large/62047_4-dc8b4060cb233901d937a58edf5e5511.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the lettuce, tomato, avocado, corn and chickpeas among bowls. Drizzle with the dressing, sprinkle with the chives and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/390475/photos/large/62047_5-8976e67a23853bdefd38d41e4e36ad8c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you want extra crispy chickpeas, continue roasting them for a further 10 mins. They'll add even more crunch to your salad!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/390476/photos/large/62047_6-b72cff87f17a6d522a16a462fbd770aa.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
